flowchart TD
    Employee["Employee"]
    Support["IT Support Staff"]
    D4[("D4: Tickets Collection")]
    D5[("D5: AuditLogs Collection")]

    P51(["5.1<br/>Ticket Submission &<br/>Input Validation"])
    P52(["5.2<br/>Automatic SLA Due Date<br/>Calculation (PRIORITY_HOURS)"])
    P53(["5.3<br/>Technician Assignment<br/>(OPEN -> IN_PROGRESS)"])
    P54(["5.4<br/>Discussion Comments Thread<br/>(1-1000 Chars)"])
    P55(["5.5<br/>Resolution Validation<br/>(Min 5 Chars Note)"])
    P56(["5.6<br/>Employee Reopen Evaluation<br/>(RESOLVED -> IN_PROGRESS)"])
    P57(["5.7<br/>Final Ticket Closure<br/>(RESOLVED -> CLOSED)"])

    Employee -->|Title, Priority, Category, Description| P51
    P51 -->|Valid Ticket Data| P52
    P52 -->|Insert OPEN with dueAt| D4
    P52 -->|Log TICKET_CREATE| D5

    Support -->|Select Technician| P53
    P53 <-->|Update assignedTo & Status| D4
    P53 -->|Log TICKET_ASSIGN| D5

    Employee & Support -->|Add Reply / Message| P54
    P54 <-->|Append to comments array| D4
    P54 -->|Log TICKET_COMMENT| D5

    Support -->|Submit Resolution Note| P55
    P55 <-->|Set resolvedAt & Status RESOLVED| D4
    P55 -->|Log TICKET_STATUS| D5

    Employee -->|Issue Persists? Reopen| P56
    P56 <-->|Clear resolvedAt, Status IN_PROGRESS| D4
    P56 -->|Log TICKET_STATUS Reopened| D5

    Support -->|Mark Completed & Close| P57
    P57 <-->|Set closedAt & Status CLOSED| D4
    P57 -->|Log TICKET_STATUS Closed| D5
